    "label": "OCM W-Stack \u00b7 uploaded TLS",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Configure kubeconfig, domain, fullchain, private key and initial access in the OCM node. Deploy resumes its matching installation. No credentials belong in this exported flow."
